teleprompter-pro (2.0.0~dev1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Development snapshot of the 2.0 series (Phases 0-1 complete).
  * Phase 0: audit and code safety — audio stream lifecycle fixed,
    thread-safe UI updates via Qt signals, real mirror mode,
    random SECRET_KEY, working-directory-independent paths,
    structured logging, config type validation.
  * Phase 1: project-based workflow — .bigprompt project format,
    MainWindow with navigation, script editor with WPM duration,
    .txt/.md/.html/.docx import, six script templates.
  * Legacy full-screen reading mode kept via --read.
  * English-first UI strings wrapped for Qt Linguist (66 messages).
  * 130 unit tests (pytest + pytest-qt).

 -- Juan Salazar Flores <wachin@debian.org>  Thu, 03 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

teleprompter-pro (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * PyQt6 based teleprompter with remote control and voice sync.
  * Remote control via QR code and WebSocket (Flask).
  * Voice synchronization using Vosk for local speech recognition.
  * Cross-platform configuration (Windows, Linux, macOS).
  * Persistent settings including scroll speed.
  * 27 unit tests included.
  * Desktop teleprompter for presentations and recordings.

 -- Juan Salazar Flores <wachin@debian.org>  Sat, 30 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000
